    {
      "label": "Komelia Home Screen (Library Dashboard) - dark-themed desktop UI showing left sidebar navigation (Home, Libraries with books/comics/example library/manga/novels(Unavailable)/touhou/webtoons, Settings) and main content area with filter tabs (All, Keep reading, Recently added series, Recently read books, Recently added books, On deck, Recently updated) plus a top search bar and window controls. Displays 'Keep reading' row with manga covers (Dai Dark v08, Ryuu to Yuusha to Haitatsunin, Abara Complete Deluxe Edition, Saikyo Cirno Mad Marukyu) each with a progress bar, and 'Recently added series' row with covers showing unread-count badges (She Doesn't Know Why She Lives., The Color of the End, Touring After the Apocalypse, Beautiful Place, Roman Album: Taishou Dennou Dadaism Emaki - Despera).",
      "file_type": "image",
      "source_file": "kotlin/screenshots/1.jpg",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "id": "kotlin_screenshots_1",
      "community": 652,
      "norm_label": "komelia home screen (library dashboard) - dark-themed desktop ui showing left sidebar navigation (home, libraries with books/comics/example library/manga/novels(unavailable)/touhou/webtoons, settings) and main content area with filter tabs (all, keep reading, recently added series, recently read books, recently added books, on deck, recently updated) plus a top search bar and window controls. displays 'keep reading' row with manga covers (dai dark v08, ryuu to yuusha to haitatsunin, abara complete deluxe edition, saikyo cirno mad marukyu) each with a progress bar, and 'recently added series' row with covers showing unread-count badges (she doesn't know why she lives., the color of the end, touring after the apocalypse, beautiful place, roman album: taishou dennou dadaism emaki - despera)."
    },
